      "created_at": "2019-08-27T07:13:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Advanced Ennead vs Setting Son Ra, Spirit of the Void Akash’Thriya, Dark Conductor Argent Adept and Dark Watch Harpy in the Nexus of the Void.</p>\n<p>It’s the Advanced Ennead and Ra has area damage, so burninate everything. Argent Adept can add more card plays for Ra to give him fodder for his power or one shots to burn things, while Harpy gets Swift Summoning in her opening hand for mor card play.</p>\n<p>Mint but everyone except the Adept was out.</p>",
