      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-27T13:17:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was so much fun. :D Didn't lose anyone, thanks to a lengthy chain of Arcane Cadences that gave me a Rhapsody of Vigor, which I could use eventually.</p>\n<p>Basically what Paul said: just use your powers to let Ra play cards, it'll be great. :)</p>",
