      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-27T13:40:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got into a cycle where I had AA let Ra play Solar Flare on his turn, then use it on Ra's turn but let it expire, then Vernal Sonata to put it back on Ra's deck, then play it with AA's power. Free Solar Flares go a long way when you've got Setting Sun Ra's power and Scorched Earths in-hand.</p>",
