      "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-27T15:30:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Same as everyone else, feeding Ra all the damages means toasty Ennead. Game ended before all the Ennead even made it out, with something like 6/28/20/22 hp left.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ra brutalized the Ennead with all the card plays, and the Vernal Sonata/Play top card combo is bruta . I was using Fire Blast, but the Solar Flare above would probably be even better. Harpy did decent damage as well with Summon the Flock repeatedly. Fun game overall.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>~Komori</p>",
