      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-28T03:17:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ennead never got to play a card after turn 1, as Argent Adept used three consecutive turns to recycle and replay As the Earth Turns. Meanwhile, Ra lit everything on fire,&nbsp;Harpy contributed some damage, and by the end Akash had 5-6 seeds out for her base power to rack up damage too.</p>",
