      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-29T05:35:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I also just kept cycling As The Earth Turns to deny the Ennead turns, while using Akash'Flora to give Ra multiple burns. Ra kept playing new ongoings to feed to his power, while his Flesh of the Sun God stayed around long enough to keep his HP up.</p>\n<p>The rest was Mint with everyone but Ra at 20+ HP. Ra was at 8 HP, and only had a total of six cards left in his hand, play area, and deck combined.&nbsp;</p>",
